// Martin's SRP example (Agile Software Development, chapter 8), the violating version: Rectangle holds area()
// (geometry) and draw() (user interface). Two axes, geometry changing less often than the user interface.
axis geometry = [martin.srp.geometry]
axis ui       = [martin.srp.ui, martin.srp.geometry.Rectangle.draw(Canvas)]
// the speed order; it generates hide ui from geometry
speed geometry < ui;
